    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_7",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Liu Yifei (born 25 August 1987), birth name An Feng (安风), legal name Liu Ximeizi (刘茜美子), also known as Crystal Liu, is a Chinese actress, model and singer. Said to be one of the most beautiful Chinese actresses, Liu is widely known as \"Fairy Sister\" in the entertainment industry for her sweet and delicate image. In 2009, she was named as one of the New Four Dan Actresses in China.",
