      "node_id": "kg_doc_2",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Crystal \"CC\" Zhang (Chinese: 张熙媛, born 12 November 1989), is a Chinese actress and model. Born in Shenyang, Zhang made her professional acting debut with the role of Liu Xinmei in the 2011 Chinese television drama \"\"Before the Dawn\"\" (Chinese: 黎明绝杀) alongside Chen Zihan. She has since had roles across film and television, appearing alongside such Asian stars as Zhang Fengyi, Bosco Wong, and Tiffany Tang.",
